    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it's not even just exhaustion. when i think about the next 20 years, compared to what i just lost, it just feels like a bad investment. like i'm throwing good money after bad, but with my life. if the game is rigged and i've already lost everything, what's even the point in staying at the table? it feels like the only logical thing left is to just stop.",
